@echo off
rem ASCII only. Japanese text in a .cmd is misread right after a code page change and the window closes at once
rem (2026-10-28). The Japanese guidance is printed by the .mjs script instead. No pause: progress goes to
rem %USERPROFILE%\.ai-runs\<name>\state.json and log.txt, which the AI reads.
chcp 65001 >nul
node "%~dp0example.mjs"
